      "STELLA: Could you sign mine?\nINGRID: Stella! I didn’t even see you…\nINGRID: Why didn’t you come straight up?\nSTELLA: I was embarrassed. You draw a crowd! A lot of young people and not just women…",
      "MARTHA: I’m fucking over this…\nINGRID: Can you help her?",
      "MARTHA: Bring it on.\nMARTHA: I’ll end up turning into a junkie. I am one already, I guess.\nINGRID: It’s okay, really.\nMARTHA: Are you still here?",
      "INGRID: No.\nINGRID: Hi, how are you?\nMARTHA: Better, much better since you said yes.\nINGRID: Where are you? Are you at home?",
      "INGRID: Thank you.\nMARTHA: According to the map, we go up these steps to enter the house.\nINGRID: Wow! It’s so beautiful!\nMARTHA: It’s so much more beautiful than the photographs!"
